# FastAPI Backend Implementation Plan

We will create a production-ready FastAPI backend with the requested features, including PyTorch model loading, image upload/prediction, MongoDB Atlas integration, and JWT authentication.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> Please review the chosen dependencies and the proposed folder structure. We will use `motor` (async MongoDB driver) and `passlib` for password hashing. We will also need a MongoDB Atlas connection string set in the environment variables (e.g., `MONGODB_URL`). Please confirm if you have a `.env` file ready with the necessary credentials.

