#### [NEW] [backend/ml/predictor.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/lung-cancer-detection-ai/backend/ml/predictor.py)
A wrapper class that initializes the PyTorch `DenseNetClassifier`, loads weights, and provides a method to preprocess uploaded images (PIL/bytes to Tensor) and perform inference, returning probabilities/confidence scores.

